    "HealthKit 权限被拒绝后，系统通常不会重复弹出授权页。请到系统设置或健康 App 的数据访问权限中为本 App 打开步数读写。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HealthKit 权限被拒绝后，系统通常不会重复弹出授权页。请到系统设置或健康 App 的数据访问权限中为本 App 打开步数读写。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HealthKit 權限被拒絕後，系統通常不會重複跳出授權頁。請到系統設定或健康 App 的資料存取權限中，為本 App 開啟步數讀寫。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once HealthKit access is denied, iOS usually won't prompt again. Enable step read/write for this app in Settings or in the Health app's data access section."
          }
        }
      }
    },
