    "踏频跟速度线性相关：拖动速度时踏频同步升降（齿比不变），拖动踏频相当于换挡。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "踏频跟速度线性相关：拖动速度时踏频同步升降（齿比不变），拖动踏频相当于换挡。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "踏頻跟速度線性相關：拖動速度時踏頻同步升降（齒比不變），拖動踏頻相當於換檔。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cadence scales linearly with speed: dragging speed moves cadence with it (same gear ratio); dragging cadence is like shifting gears."
          }
        }
      }
    },
