    "遇到「VPN 未连接 / 等待 VPN」等问题时，点这里生成核心状态快照，再分享给开发者排查。日志不含 pairing file 内容或定位数据。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到「VPN 未连接 / 等待 VPN」等问题时，点这里生成核心状态快照，再分享给开发者排查。日志不含 pairing file 内容或定位数据。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到「VPN 未連線 / 等待 VPN」等問題時，點這裡產生核心狀態快照，再分享給開發者排查。紀錄不含 pairing file 內容或定位資料。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hitting problems like “VPN not connected” or “waiting for VPN”? Generate a snapshot of the core state here and share it with the developer. It contains no pairing file contents or location data."
          }
        }
      }
